{
  "title": "Very Dense Canadian Lamb Stew",
  "description": "A malty, dense, and satisfying Canadian dish featuring kabse spice, perfect for midnight cravings, and shojin-friendly. This stew is made with lamb and a blend of spices.",
  "cuisine": "Canadian",
  "diet": [
